================================================================================
Reference implementations, read but not distributed
================================================================================

docs/op-spec.md records what each operator computes, read from the model's own
modelling code in Hugging Face Transformers (Copyright Hugging Face, Apache
License 2.0) and from the Qwen release's configuration files. The wiring of the
multi-token-prediction head was read from vLLM (Copyright vLLM contributors,
Apache License 2.0) at the commit named in docs/op-spec.md. No source file from
either is included in this repository, and the Rust implementation is written
against docs/op-spec.md rather than translated from them.


